    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel between different planets</h2>You finally got an internship at the intergalactic Research Station, congrats! You messed up with coords and landed far away from your destination, but who cares? You'll be there in no time! Survive the route to the Research Station, experience gravity inversion, conversion to a hologram and weightlessness, talk to burn-out workers, and of course - avoid getting killed by local aliens!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Jump, dodge, jump, collect, die... wait, what?</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/dec4e18da17bb7e9917a4caa057afd1a.poster.avif?t=1689948390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/dec4e18da17bb7e9917a4caa057afd1a.webm?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/dec4e18da17bb7e9917a4caa057afd1a.mp4?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Talk to smart workers</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/9c21be2503db5fe5605dc2fe3ecb5094.poster.avif?t=1689948390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/9c21be2503db5fe5605dc2fe3ecb5094.webm?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/9c21be2503db5fe5605dc2fe3ecb5094.mp4?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don't eat too much before the gravity inversion!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/493a3c20f81b4dd360dc2a302ed72a18.poster.avif?t=1689948390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/493a3c20f81b4dd360dc2a302ed72a18.webm?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/493a3c20f81b4dd360dc2a302ed72a18.mp4?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Surf through the HoloNet</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/a2d3abbca75279bc97f29f71c5c417a1.poster.avif?t=1689948390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/a2d3abbca75279bc97f29f71c5c417a1.webm?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/a2d3abbca75279bc97f29f71c5c417a1.mp4?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Look into beautiful eyes</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/86301ea8fdc698593ffd716179247dd6.poster.avif?t=1689948390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/86301ea8fdc698593ffd716179247dd6.webm?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121090/extras/86301ea8fdc698593ffd716179247dd6.mp4?t=1689948390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Game features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 4 unique worlds with different mechanics inside<br></li><li> 40 hand-crafted levels (+ additional levels for collecting stars)<br></li><li> different enemies on every planet<br></li><li> 4 bosses<br></li><li> funny dialogues with quirky space station workers<br></li><li> this list will be updated soon with more features as I will add it to the game :)</li></ul><br><strong>Please note</strong>: Space Intern is a title that is still in development, any information provided here may be subject to future changes. This page will be updated with more information, and details as content development progress. Thank you for your understanding.",
